    <body>
        <%- include('_header'); %>
        <main id="main">
            <section class="page-hero">
                <div class="container">
                    <div class="eyebrow">Donate</div>
                    <h1>Give where the work is.</h1>
                    <p>Choose a fund, a gift, and we will put it to motorcycle safety, gear, youth licenses, Scouts, or Christmas for kids in foster care.</p>
                </div>
            </section>
            <section class="section">
                <div class="container">
                    <div class="section-head">
                        <div class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--green-2)">Choose a fund</div>
                        <h2>Where should your gift go?</h2>
                    </div>
                    <div class="fund-grid">
                        <div class="fund"><strong>Where it is needed most</strong><span class="muted">Unrestricted support we put toward the next rider, kid, or family who needs it.</span></div>
                        <div class="fund"><strong>Motorcycle safety education</strong><span class="muted">Classes, curriculum, and instructors who teach young adults to ride with judgment.</span></div>
                        <div class="fund"><strong>Motorcycle gear drive</strong><span class="muted">Helmets, jackets, gloves, and boots for riders who cannot afford protective gear.</span></div>
                        <div class="fund"><strong>Youth hunting and fishing licenses</strong><span class="muted">State licenses so Michigan kids can hunt and fish without the fee standing in the way.</span></div>
                        <div class="fund"><strong>Scouts camp and uniforms</strong><span class="muted">Summer camp fees and uniforms for Boy Scouts and Girl Scouts.</span></div>
                        <div class="fund"><strong>Christmas fund</strong><span class="muted">Gifts and holiday support for children in foster care.</span></div>
                    </div>
